    "updated_at": "2022-11-02T02:40:57Z",
    "body": "Checked Gecko (Firefox Nightly on Android with prefs orientation prefs enabled) and it does also exhibit this behavior (it unlocks the orientation lock when exiting full screen). Where it differs is that it doesn't reject the orientation lock's pending promise - but that is minor.\r\n\r\n@EdgarChen, given the above, would you be supportive of this change? ",
