    "body": "Yes, Gecko unlock the orientation lock after document exits fullscreen, see https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/17349477695facefe7d180d7afc2b74a965c21db/dom/base/ScreenOrientation.cpp#715, so it looks good to me. I filed https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1798646.",
